      "subject": "Builder typechecks clean, and the build enforces it",
      "body": "vite build never ran tsc, so type errors piled up unseen (384 at the\nstart of this mission). The last 13 were stale tests: tests for modules\ndeleted in 0ea2a288, Genesis fixtures that predate newer projection\nfields, and an `as any` reaching a field that no longer exists. The two\nsuperseded v1 Knowledge Operations files, unreachable from main.tsx,\nare removed with owner approval.\n\nnpm run build now runs typecheck:builder before building, so a type\nerror stops the build instead of shipping.\n\nMission: MS-2026-0006\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AHtXdN7VRusNxTFHzk5uFe",
